  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I am ending my story, and so many of its questions are still unsettled.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 5.68
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Yet I write on. Carver's germs most likely killed them.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 6.458,
      "seconds": 3.78
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Only earthly bacteria were found in their bodies, yet it stays unproven.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 10.75,
      "seconds": 5.82
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The Black Smoke is still unknown, and the generator of the Heat-Ray remains a puzzle.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 17.083,
      "seconds": 5.08
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A graver question hangs over us.",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 22.667,
      "seconds": 3.15
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Each time Mars swings near, I expect them to try again.",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 26.833,
      "seconds": 4.26
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Lessing believes they have already made a landing on Venus.",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 31.625,
      "seconds": 4.22
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Now each shooting star that falls brings us fear.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 36.375,
      "seconds": 4.11
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "If they can reach Venus, so might we one day.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 41.0,
      "seconds": 3.76
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Or perhaps their defeat is only a reprieve.",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 45.667,
      "seconds": 3.15
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I sit here by lamplight, and suddenly the valley below is burning again.",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 49.333,
      "seconds": 5.61
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The house behind me stands empty.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 55.458,
      "seconds": 2.62
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "On the Byfleet Road, carts and children pass me, then fade like smoke.",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 58.583,
      "seconds": 5.36
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Nights bring back the black powder.",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 64.458,
      "seconds": 2.11
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The dead rise at me out of it, and I wake, chilled and wretched, in the dark.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 67.083,
      "seconds": 7.38
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I go to London.",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 75.0,
      "seconds": 1.51
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The crowds fill Fleet Street, yet to me they are ghosts in a dead city.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 78.375,
      "seconds": 4.45
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Yesterday I stood on Primrose Hill among the flower beds, and I turned and reached for her hand.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 83.333,
      "seconds": 6.78
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Sight-seers stroll round the machine that stands there still, and children shout at their games beneath its legs.",
      "shot": 20,
      "at": 90.625,
      "seconds": 7.86
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I saw this hill bright and hard and silent, under the dawn of that last day.",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 99.0,
      "seconds": 5.28
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "And strangest of all is the one who walks in through my study door tonight.",
      "shot": 22,
      "at": 104.792,
      "seconds": 5.03
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I hold my wife's hand again.",
      "shot": 23,
      "at": 110.333,
      "seconds": 2.46
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Each of us had counted the other among the dead.",
      "shot": 23,
      "at": 113.493,
      "seconds": 3.4
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "narrators_wife",
      "text": "I had counted you among the dead too, my dear, and here you are, warm.",
      "shot": 25,
      "at": 119.125,
      "seconds": 4.64
    }
  ],
  "plan": "77eaa2b0da41f860"
}